// wall_joins (docs/testing.md): where walls meet each other, a tower and a gate - the round posts the game's layout
// puts there: random_map=Highlands,ai_count=2,seed=7,start_epoch=5,game_seed=1,wall_slopes=1,wall_joins=0|1
// (Middle Ages: wall 469, tower 463, gate 444; the game leaves the steepest tiles out of a wall - gaps at 64..66,76,
// 65..66,73..74, 56,58, 62,58). P2: the wall along y 76 (x 62..75), a tower at 83,76; at 12 min a diagonal one across
// it (62,70 .. 72,80), at 16 min one on along the same line from the tile after its east end up to the tower (76..82),
// at 20 min one up to its side (74,77 .. 74,83). P3: the wall along y 58 (x 48..62), at 24 min a gate in it (49..53,58).
// At 28 min P2's piece at 79,76 destroyed (the wall's ends beside it). Paused at 32 min.

wait_until(1min)
give(2, 3000, resource.all)
give(3, 3000, resource.all)
spawn(2, unit.b_guard_tower_middle, 83, 76)
wall(2, unit.b_wall_middle, 62, 76, 75, 76)
wall(3, unit.b_wall_middle, 48, 58, 62, 58)
wait_until(12min)
wall(2, unit.b_wall_middle, 62, 70, 72, 80)
wait_until(16min)
wall(2, unit.b_wall_middle, 76, 76, 82, 76)
wait_until(20min)
wall(2, unit.b_wall_middle, 74, 77, 74, 83)
wait_until(24min)
gate(3, unit.b_gate_middle, 51, 58, 1)
wait_until(28min)
hurt(2, unit.b_wall_middle, 79, 76, 0, 100000)
wait_until(32min)
pause()
